				"name": "legacyReport",
				"type": "LegacyReport | undefined",
				"description": "An object with project (the manifest's id, name and path, which the LegacyReport type comment says is used only to decide whether the run is this repository's) and record (a schemaVersion 1, kind 'legacy-report' record whose project is the name, or the id when the name is empty), for a valid manifest. Status, state, startedAt and updatedAt are copied unchanged, so a run still marked running stays running; revision is trimmed or null when missing or blank, checks keep only id, title and status, each media item has provenance 'legacy-report' with sha256 and bytes set to null, and undefined is returned when validation fails.",
